because of me today

3
00:00:05,631 --> 00:00:06,965
No, it's nothing

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:10,677
You were not that bad
compared to others

5
00:00:11,678 --> 00:00:12,678
Wait

6
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:15,349
Your lips are swollen

7
00:00:15,474 --> 00:00:17,226
You worked too hard
on the kiss scene

8
00:00:17,351 --> 00:00:20,479
