13
00:00:29,905 --> 00:00:32,950
Well, I could've had
some fun while drunk

14
00:00:33,075 --> 00:00:35,994
But Hyesung, that punk
is fucking naive…

15
00:00:38,538 --> 00:00:39,539
Say that again

16
00:00:41,083 --> 00:00:42,123
What did you do
to Hyesung?

17
00:00:43,460 --> 00:00:44,795
Hey, calm down

18
00:00:47,381 --> 00:00:48,924
I haven't done
anything yet

19
00:00:49,049 --> 00:00:50,384
You crazy bastard!

20
00:00:53,428 --> 00:00:55,847
Hey, why are you
being so dramatic?

21
00:00:55,973 --> 00:00:59,434
I guess Hyesung
is dating another guy

22
00:01:12,364 --> 00:01:13,364
Damn it

23
00:01:18,370 --> 00:01:19,705
Touch Lee Hyesung
one more time

24
00:01:20,747 --> 00:01:22,124
and I won't let it slide

25
00:01:31,842 --> 00:01:33,051
God damn it!

26
00:01:37,681 --> 00:01:38,849
