27
00:01:38,974 --> 00:01:40,642
Uh, you're here
You did a great job

28
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:43,437
How about we ask Yoo-il
to go to the wrap party…

29
00:01:43,562 --> 00:01:44,438
Yoo-il?

30
00:01:44,563 --> 00:01:46,064
He left earlier

31
00:01:47,232 --> 00:01:47,774
Did he?

32
00:01:47,899 --> 00:01:48,483
Yes

33
00:01:48,608 --> 00:01:49,818
Hop on, let's go
to the party

34
00:01:49,943 --> 00:01:50,943
Come on
